# Cloudflare Pages _redirects
# This site is deployed on Cloudflare Pages (server: cloudflare, cf-cache-status
# in response headers, _headers file is honored but netlify.toml is not).
#
# Pages serves "pretty URLs" by 307-redirecting /foo.html -> /foo. We override
# that with explicit 301s so search engines consolidate link equity to the
# canonical extensionless URL. The trailing "!" forces our rule to win over
# Pages' built-in 307.
#
# Reference: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

# Legacy .html URLs -> extensionless canonical (301, forced)
/index.html             /                          301!
/apply.html             /apply                     301!
/cma.html               /cma                       301!
/cma-success.html       /cma-success               301!
/cookie-policy.html     /cookie-policy             301!
/join.html              /join                      301!
